- Exit 1 in 173.70 seconds

The inspected failures were concentrated in Windows `Access denied` / `PermissionError` paths while tests attempted atomic audit writes or resolved controller temporary directories. The suite was not rerun or expanded.

The optimizer-related agent-loop selection was run exactly once for diagnostic separation:

- 96 passed
