All four failures reported Windows `Access denied` / `PermissionError` while using test-created audit or controller temporary paths. This suite was not rerun or expanded.

The two warnings in each suite were the repository's unsupported `cache_dir` pytest option and the upstream `websockets.legacy` deprecation.

