The recovery made no OpenRouter/provider call, provider SDK construction, network access, live pricing lookup, grant creation, authorization lease, Docker command, hidden-fold evaluation, long replay, candidate backtest, source apply, commit, merge, push, upload, deploy, or cloud task. The only replay was the one permitted two-discovery-fold parity attempt, which stopped on the entry-risk invariant before writing its attestation. There were zero live role calls, zero provider tokens, and zero provider spend.

